             ,HELPFUL HINTS

,FOR EVERYONE3 ,FOUR PICTURES1 FOUR
  SOURCES3 A WOOD FIRE1 A CANDLE1 GAS
  AND ELECTRICITY4 ,THINK3 WHICH OF
